<title>SWITZERLAND: 13 of world's 20 most expensive cities in Asia.</title>
<headline>13 of world's 20 most expensive cities in Asia.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists the world's 20 most expensive cities according to a survey issued on Tuesday by the Geneva-based Corporate Resources Group. The cost-of-living survey used New York City as the base of 100 index points:</p>
<p>    Rank  City		    Index</p>
<p>    1.    Tokyo		   169.57</p>
<p>    2.    Hong Kong	     153.20</p>
<p>    3.    Moscow		  153.03</p>
<p>    4.    Osaka (Japan)	 147.86</p>
<p>    5.    Beijing		 140.92</p>
<p>    6.    Shanghai (China)    136.24</p>
<p>    7.    Seoul		   132.95</p>
<p>    8.    Singapore	     126.51</p>
<p>    9.    Guangzhou (China)   119.98</p>
<p>   10.    St. Petersburg	117.75</p>
<p>   11.    Shenzhen (China)    117.12</p>
<p>   12.    Taipei		  115.80</p>
<p>   13.    Kiev		    114.86</p>
<p>   14.    London		  114.16</p>
<p>   15.    Sao Paulo	     110.89</p>
<p>   16.    Dalian (China)	107.69</p>
<p>   17.    Ho Chi Minh City    107.60</p>
<p>   18.    Jakarta		 107.35</p>
<p>   19.    Dar es Salaam	 106.78</p>
<p>   20.    Nassau		  105.77</p>
</text>
